Package: apachegui
Version: [[version]]
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openjdk-17-jre-headless | openjdk-21-jre-headless | default-jre-headless, apache2
Maintainer: Ulrich Papendick <ulipde@googlemail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ulipde4711/ApacheGUI
Description: Web UI for managing the Apache HTTP Server
 ApacheGUI is a Java/Spring Boot web application for configuring and
 controlling a local Apache HTTP Server through the browser. It runs as a
 systemd service and listens on port 8080.
